---
title: Chocolate Cake
portions: 8
category: Dessert
source: "Classic brownie-style"
---

## Prep

[Preheat] Preheat the oven to ^{175°C}.

[Line] Butter and flour a #square pan{}.

## Batter ->&batter

[Melt] Melt the @butter{115 g} in a #saucepan{}. ->&melted butter{}

[Mix] In a #mixing bowl{}, stir the @sugar{200 g}, the @vanilla extract{1 tsp} and the @coffee{60 ml}. ->&sugar mix{}

[Add eggs] Whisk the @egg{2} into the &sugar mix{}.

[Fold] Fold the &melted butter{}, the @flour{80 g}, the @cocoa{60 g}, the @baking-powder{1/4 tsp} and the @salt{1/4 tsp} into the batter.

## Baking

[Fill] Pour the &batter into the #square pan.

[Bake] Bake at ^{175°C} for ~{35 min}, until a skewer comes out clean.
